###Block: Appendix A -- New Feats, Spells and Class Features
Additional Augmentation	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:General	MULT:YES	STACK:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Augmentations ~ Augmented Creature	BONUS:ABILITYPOOL|Augmentation|3	DESC:You gain the ability to add more augmentations to your form.	BENEFIT:You gain +3 APs that can be used to gain augmentations.	SOURCEPAGE:p.297
Eye Caster	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:General	MULT:YES	STACK:YES	CHOOSE:NOCHOICE	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Eye Rays ~ Eye King	DESC:One of an eye king's eye stalks can cast spells of a selected class.	BENEFIT:One of an eye king's eye rays no longer casts spell-like abilities but becomes a conduit from which it casts its class spells of one selected class. A spell cast this way emanates as a ray from the selected eye stalk and keeps all its other qualities. The caster level for the eye caster spell equals the eye king's class level in the chosen spellcasting class. This feat can be taken multiple times, each time for a different eye and spellcasting class.	SOURCEPAGE:p.297
Legion of Folded Paper	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:General	DESC:A true master over the rice-paper soldiers, spies and servants summoned to your side via talismans, your study has made you greatly gifted in the strange art of calling forth masses of ofuda companions.	BENEFIT:Whenever you cast summon monster or summon nature's ally as a spell or spell-like ability, you may call 1d4+1 ofuda creatures of the spell's level rather than 1d3. You also gain +1 ofuda creature of the appropriate type for every level by which the spell effect exceeds the summon table on which the selected creature appears. This does not apply to summoning through the summon universal monster ability.	SOURCEPAGE:p.297
Monstrous Mount	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:General	PRELEVEL:MIN=11	DESC:Your loyal steed has the qualities of two mighty beasts in one.	BENEFIT:Your bonded mount gains the teratocephalos template. Even though your mount becomes a magical beast, you may still treat it as an animal for Handle Animal, wild empathy, and any other spell or class ability that specifically affects animals.	SOURCEPAGE:p.297
Powerful Eye Ray	CATEGORY:FEAT	TYPE:General	PREABILITY:1,CATEGORY=Special Ability,Eye Rays ~ Eye King	DESC:One of an eye king's eye rays is much more powerful than normal.	BENEFIT:An eye king can select any spell up to the maximum level allowed for one of your eye rays in your other eye rays. Normally an eye king can only select a spell of a given level once it has already selected at least one spell of every lower level.	SOURCEPAGE:p.297

